Table full name: GOOG_BLOCKCHAIN.GOOG_BLOCKCHAIN_ARBITRUM_ONE_US.DECODED_EVENTS
Column name: TRANSACTION_HASH Type: TEXT Description: Hash of the transaction this event was emitted on.
Column name: ARGS Type: TEXT Description: Decoded event arguments serialized as a JSON array.
Column name: TOPICS Type: VARIANT Description: The indexed topics of the event.
Column name: BLOCK_NUMBER Type: NUMBER Description: Number of the block this event was emitted on.
Column name: LOG_INDEX Type: NUMBER Description: The event's index position in the transaction.
Column name: BLOCK_HASH Type: TEXT Description: Hash of the block this event was emitted on.
Column name: BLOCK_TIMESTAMP Type: NUMBER Description: Unix timestamp when the block was added to the blockchain.
Column name: REMOVED Type: BOOLEAN Description: Whether or not the event was orphaned off the main chain.
