Column name: EVENT_HASH Type: TEXT Description: Keccak hash of the event signature.
Column name: TRANSACTION_INDEX Type: NUMBER Description: The transaction's index position in the block.
Column name: ADDRESS Type: TEXT Description: Address from which this event originated.
